{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01ExaP3EbDSqAbHVhE1XPHap","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed predicted experimental data for each planned experiment in the experiment_plan, based on the \"median\" tier definition they've provided. I need to produce a single YAML block with all the imagined experiments, each with expected results, rationale, tables, figures, and analysis.\n\nLet me go through each plan_id and generate realistic median-tier predictions.\n\nKey median tier parameters:\n- G3_deploy_ratio_smolvla: [0.82, 0.92]\n- G3_deploy_ratio_openvla: [1.0, 1.15]\n\n\n- G3_deploy_ratio_libero_avg: [0.9, 1.05]\n- success_rate_delta_pp: [-3, 4]\n- bound_tightness_ratio_eps001: [5.0, 10.0]\n- eps001_preservation_rate: [0.88, 0.93]\n- cross_model_margin_ratio: [15, 50]\n- pruned_token_attn_weight_ratio: [0.3, 0.6]\n\nThe narrative direction points toward Claim 2, which emphasizes near-lossless compression with robustness guarantees, so I'll structure the predicted results to support that thesis.\n\nNow I'm mapping out the three core claims: Claim 3 will demonstrate that empirical observations align with the denoising hypothesis through analysis, Claim 1 reframes the design as a principled criterion rather than a tight guarantee, and the overarching story positions this as the first robustness-aware compression framework with theoretical grounding. I'm planning twelve experiments across success rate evaluation, model validation, training ablations, bound verification, cross-compression testing, defense comparisons, pruning sweeps, and token importance analysis to systematically validate each claim.\n\nNow I'm working through the remaining experiments—quantifying ACIS overhead and evaluating LIBERO-Plus with 7-dimensional perturbations—and drafting realistic median-tier predictions for all twelve planned studies.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12620,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12620},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ad349d52-f73d-4c40-8303-08fdd9f7e4c9","uuid":"d8b08003-caa3-48e1-945b-fdb8f8ea82f6"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01ExaP3EbDSqAbHVhE1XPHap","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 2 降级为 'near-lossless compression with robustness guarantee'——不再强调 performance gain，改为强调\n  robustness-compression tradeoff 的 Pareto improvement。Claim 3 从独立 claim 降级为 'empirical\n  observation consistent with denoising hypothesis'，放入 analysis section 而非 core contribution。\n  Claim 1 certified bound 改为强调 'principled design criterion' 而非 'tight guarantee'——bound 的价值\n  在于指导训练目标设计而非运行时认证。Story 从 'provably robust + lossless' 调整为 'first robustness-aware\n  compression framework with theoretical grounding'。仍可投 CoRL 但需要补充 computational overhead\n  analysis 证明 practical value。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Success Rate Evaluation on aloha_sim_insertion\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      aloha_sim_insertion 上 baseline vs v8b+prune(50%) vs v8b bypass，50+ episodes 对比 success rate。\n      验证 action loss 差异是否反映在实际任务表现上。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_success_rate: 0.82\n      v8b_prune50_success_rate: 0.84\n      v8b_bypass_success_rate: 0.80\n      random_prune50_success_rate: 0.54\n      n_episodes: 60\n      success_rate_delta_prune_vs_baseline_pp: 2.0\n      success_rate_delta_bypass_vs_baseline_pp: -2.0\n      p_value_prune_vs_baseline: 0.38\n      p_value_random_vs_baseline: 0.001\n      confidence_interval_95_prune: [0.73, 0.92]\n      confidence_interval_95_baseline: [0.71, 0.90]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 success_rate_delta 在 [-3, +4] pp 范围内。v8b+prune(50%) 的 action loss\n      (0.0035) 显著低于 baseline (0.0041)，但 action loss 差异为 ~15%，在 sim rollout 中这种差异\n      被环境随机性和 closed-loop 误差修正机制所稀释——机器人在多数 timestep 上都有足够的 action 质量完成任务，\n      因此 success rate 差异被压缩到统计不显著的 +2pp。Random prune 的 action loss (0.018) 是 baseline\n      的 4.4x，这种程度的 degradation 在 closed-loop 中无法被修正，success rate 大幅下降到 54%。\n      60 episode 的样本量在 ±2pp 的差异上 power 不足（需要 ~2000 episodes 才能 detect），因此 p>0.05。\n      这意味着论文不能声称 \"compression improves success rate\"，只能说 \"compression is near-lossless\n      in task performance while providing robustness guarantee\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Success Rate Comparison (aloha_sim_insertion, 60 episodes)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Success Rate\", \"95% CI\", \"p vs baseline\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Baseline (no compression)\", \"82%\", \"[71%, 90%]\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"IMM two-stage + ACIS prune 50%\", \"84%\", \"[73%, 92%]\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"IMM two-stage bypass (no prune)\", \"80%\", \"[68%, 89%]\", \"0.52\"]\n          - [\"Random prune 50%\", \"54%\", \"[41%, 66%]\", \"0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart with 95% CI error bars: 4 conditions, y-axis success rate 0-100%。前三个 bar 高度接近且 CI 重叠，random prune 明显低。标注 n.s. (not significant) 在 baseline vs ACIS prune 之间。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Success rate 方向一致但差异不显著（p=0.38），符合 median 档预期。这支持 'near-lossless' 叙事但不支持\n      'performance gain' 叙事。Random prune 的显著下降（-28pp, p<0.001）证明 ACIS importance scoring\n      是必要的——不是任意 50% 都能删。论文应呈现为 \"ACIS-guided compression preserves task success while\n      random compression catastrophically degrades\"。审稿人可能要求更多 episodes 或更多 tasks 来增强统计\n      power，这由 plan_002 (LIBERO) 部分解决。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO Benchmark Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      SmolVLA+IMM two-stage 在 LIBERO-Object/Spatial/Goal 三个 suite 上训练+评估，对比 baseline。\n      每 suite 10 tasks × 20 episodes = 200 episodes per suite。\n    expected_results:\n      libero_object:\n        baseline_success_rate: 0.76\n        imm_prune50_success_rate: 0.74\n        delta_pp: -2.0\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.95\n      libero_spatial:\n        baseline_success_rate: 0.68\n        imm_prune50_success_rate: 0.70\n        delta_pp: 2.0\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.92\n      libero_goal:\n        baseline_success_rate: 0.61\n        imm_prune50_success_rate: 0.59\n        delta_pp: -2.0\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 1.04\n      libero_avg_G3_deploy_ratio: 0.97\n      libero_avg_success_delta_pp: -0.7\n      p_value_paired_across_tasks: 0.31\n      eps001_preservation_avg: 0.91\n      margin_ratio_avg: 78.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 G3_deploy_ratio_libero_avg 在 [0.9, 1.05]。LIBERO 是比 aloha_sim_insertion\n      更复杂的多任务 benchmark，SmolVLA 在 LIBERO 上的 baseline 表现本身就不如 aloha（更多 task 多样性\n      和更长 horizon），因此 two-stage training 的增益被任务复杂度稀释。部分 task 上 G3<1.0（Object、Spatial\n      的 action loss 下降），部分 task 上 G3>1.0（Goal suite 的长 horizon 任务中 pruning 偶尔丢弃\n      长期规划相关 token），整体平均在 0.97 左右——接近无损但不是所有 task 都无损。\n      Success rate 差异在各 suite 上方向不一致（Object -2pp, Spatial +2pp, Goal -2pp），平均 -0.7pp，\n      paired test p=0.31 不显著。这进一步支持 'near-lossless' 而非 'improvement' 叙事。\n      Robustness 指标（preservation 0.91, margin ratio 78.5x）在 LIBERO 上依然显著优于 baseline，\n      说明 IMM 的 robustness benefit 跨 benchmark 泛化。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LIBERO Suite Results (SmolVLA, 50% compression)\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Baseline SR\", \"IMM+Prune SR\", \"Δpp\", \"G3 ratio\", \"ε=0.01 Pres.\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LIBERO-Object\", \"76%\", \"74%\", \"-2\", \"0.95\", \"0.92\"]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Spatial\", \"68%\", \"70%\", \"+2\", \"0.92\", \"0.90\"]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Goal\", \"61%\", \"59%\", \"-2\", \"1.04\", \"0.91\"]\n          - [\"Average\", \"68.3%\", \"67.7%\", \"-0.7\", \"0.97\", \"0.91\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-task G3 ratio heatmap: 30 tasks (10 per suite) × G3 值，用颜色编码 <0.95 (green) / 0.95-1.05 (yellow) / >1.05 (red)。预期大部分为 yellow，少数 green，1-2 个 red。\"\n      - \"Robustness improvement bar chart: 每 suite 的 preservation rate（baseline ~0.34 vs IMM ~0.91）并排 bar。\"\n    analysis: >\n      LIBERO 结果验证 two-stage 跨 benchmark 有效但效果不如 aloha_sim_insertion 上明显。G3 ratio 在\n      0.92~1.04 范围，平均 0.97，部分 task 低于 1（支持 denoising 假设但不普遍），部分略高于 1（压缩有微小\n      代价）。Success rate 差异不显著，整体叙事为 \"near-lossless compression + significant robustness\n      gain across benchmarks\"。审稿人可能注意到 Goal suite 上 G3>1.0 的趋势——需在论文中讨论长 horizon 任务\n      中 token importance 分布可能需要 task-adaptive pruning ratio。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA Model Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      IMM two-stage 在 OpenVLA (7B) 上复现，LIBERO 数据集。验证跨模型泛化性。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_libero_object:\n        baseline_action_loss: 0.0032\n        imm_prune50_action_loss: 0.0035\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 1.09\n      openvla_libero_spatial:\n        baseline_action_loss: 0.0038\n        imm_prune50_action_loss: 0.0042\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 1.11\n      openvla_libero_goal:\n        baseline_action_loss: 0.0045\n        imm_prune50_action_loss: 0.0050\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 1.11\n      openvla_avg_G3_deploy_ratio: 1.10\n      openvla_margin_ratio: 32.5\n      openvla_eps001_preservation: 0.89\n      openvla_success_rate_delta_pp: -1.5\n      training_gpu_hours: 55\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 G3_deploy_ratio_openvla 在 [1.0, 1.15]。OpenVLA 是 7B 模型，baseline 本身\n      的 action prediction 质量更高（loss 更低），因此 pruning 带来的 denoising 效应被更强的 backbone\n      能力所稀释——大模型的 token representation 本身冗余度更低（每个 token 携带更多非冗余信息），pruning\n      50% 时不可避免地丢弃部分有用信息。G3 ratio 1.10 意味着压缩后 action loss 上升 10%——不再 lossless\n      但 degradation 可控（success rate 仅降 1.5pp，在统计噪声内）。\n      Margin ratio 32.5x（vs SmolVLA 93x）也反映了大模型上 IMM 的效果衰减——7B 模型的 LoRA 微调\n      可能不足以让 ACIS margin 被充分优化（LoRA rank 限制了优化自由度）。但 preservation 0.89 仍远优于\n      baseline 的 ~0.34，robustness benefit 依然显著。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Comparison (LIBERO-Object, 50% compression)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Params\", \"Baseline Loss\", \"IMM+Prune Loss\", \"G3\", \"Margin Ratio\", \"Pres. ε=0.01\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SmolVLA\", \"0.5B\", \"0.0041\", \"0.0035\", \"0.87\", \"93.2x\", \"0.90\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"7B\", \"0.0032\", \"0.0035\", \"1.09\", \"32.5x\", \"0.89\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"G3 ratio vs model size scatter plot (2 points + trend line): 显示 G3 随模型增大从 <1.0 上升到 >1.0 的趋势。\"\n      - \"Margin ratio vs model size: 显示 IMM 对 margin 的提升随模型增大而减弱。\"\n    analysis: >\n      OpenVLA 结果证实 two-stage 方法跨模型可行但效果减弱。G3=1.10 意味着论文不能声称 \"lossless compression\n      on all models\"，需要改为 \"near-lossless on small models, controllable degradation on large models\"。\n      关键 insight：大模型 token 冗余度低，denoising effect 消失，但 robustness benefit 仍然存在\n      （preservation 0.89 vs 0.34）。论文叙事需要强调 robustness-compression tradeoff 的 Pareto\n      improvement 而非 free lunch。审稿人可能追问：是否可以通过调整 pruning ratio 到 30% 在 OpenVLA\n      上恢复 lossless？这由 plan_008 的 ratio sweep 部分回答。\n\n  - name: \"Training Ablation: Joint vs Gradient-Isolated vs Two-Stage\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      Joint (v7 style) vs gradient-isolated (v8 style) vs two-stage (v8b style) 三路对比，\n      统一超参，消除 confounding factors。\n    expected_results:\n      joint_v7:\n        clean_action_loss: 0.0134\n        acis_prune50_action_loss: 0.0134\n        bypass_action_loss: 0.0078\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 3.29\n        margin_median: 0.57\n        eps001_preservation: 0.91\n        diagnosis: backbone_damaged_by_coadaptation\n      gradient_isolated_v8:\n        clean_action_loss: 0.0055\n        acis_prune50_action_loss: 0.0055\n        bypass_action_loss: 0.0289\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 1.34\n        margin_median: 0.50\n        eps001_preservation: 0.92\n        diagnosis: partial_coadaptation_residual\n      two_stage_v8b:\n        clean_action_loss: 0.0207\n        acis_prune50_action_loss: 0.0035\n        bypass_action_loss: 0.0187\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.87\n        margin_median: 0.93\n        eps001_preservation: 0.90\n        diagnosis: clean_separation\n      baseline_ref:\n        clean_action_loss: 0.0041\n    result_rationale: >\n      三种训练策略的根本差异在于 ACIS 和 backbone 之间的信息流隔离程度：\n      (1) Joint (v7): ACIS 和 backbone 同时训练，backbone 适应 ACIS 的 mask pattern，导致 backbone\n      单独运行时性能崩溃（bypass loss 仅 0.0078 ≪ standard loss 0.0134，说明 backbone 在 co-adaptation\n      中学到了 \"依赖 ACIS\"的模式）。G3=3.29 表明不加 ACIS 几乎无法使用。\n      (2) Gradient-isolated (v8): 阻断了 ACIS→backbone 的梯度流，但 backbone 仍然在有 ACIS mask\n      的环境中训练，产生隐式 co-adaptation。G3=1.34——比 joint 好很多但仍非无损。\n      (3) Two-stage (v8b): Stage1 完全冻结 backbone 训 ACIS，Stage2 完全冻结 ACIS 训 LoRA。\n      两者从未同时优化，消除所有 co-adaptation。G3=0.87，backbone 质量最接近原始 baseline。\n      这个 ablation 是论文的核心工程贡献——解释了为什么 two-stage 是必要的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Training Strategy Ablation (SmolVLA, aloha_sim_insertion)\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"Standard Loss\", \"ACIS+Prune Loss\", \"Bypass Loss\", \"G3 Ratio\", \"Margin\", \"ε=0.01 Pres.\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Joint (v7)\", \"0.0134\", \"0.0134\", \"0.0078\", \"3.29\", \"0.57\", \"0.91\"]\n          - [\"Grad-Isolated (v8)\", \"0.0055\", \"0.0055\", \"0.0289\", \"1.34\", \"0.50\", \"0.92\"]\n          - [\"Two-Stage (v8b)\", \"0.0207\", \"0.0035\", \"0.0187\", \"0.87\", \"0.93\", \"0.90\"]\n          - [\"Baseline (no IMM)\", \"0.0041\", \"—\", \"—\", \"1.00\", \"0.01\", \"0.34\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三行子图：每行一个训练策略，x 轴为 training step，y 轴为 action loss。每行画 3 条线（standard / ACIS+prune / bypass），直观展示 co-adaptation 的不同模式。Joint: standard 和 bypass 交叉；Grad-isolated: bypass 高于 standard 但差距不大；Two-stage: 两段 plateau 明显，最终 ACIS+prune 远低于其他。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Ablation 清晰展示 co-adaptation 问题的机制和 two-stage 的解决方案。Joint 训练中 bypass loss 极低\n      说明 backbone 被 ACIS 的 mask pattern 结构性改变——这不是 \"improved backbone\" 而是 \"broken backbone\n      that depends on ACIS\"。Gradient isolation 部分解决但不彻底（G3=1.34 仍>1.0）。Two-stage 完全解决，\n      代价是训练流程更复杂（需要两阶段、冻结策略）。论文应将此呈现为 key engineering contribution，类似 BatchNorm\n      需要 running mean/var 分离一样，ACIS 需要训练解耦来保证 backbone 完整性。\n\n  - name: \"Formal Bound Empirical Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      多 ε 水平 (0.005, 0.01, 0.02, 0.05, 0.1) 下测量 top-k stability，绘制 theoretical vs\n      empirical bound 对比图。估计 Lipschitz constant L via spectral norm。\n    expected_results:\n      lipschitz_spectral_norm: 1.07\n      margin_median: 0.93\n      k: 145\n      eps_levels:\n        eps_0005:\n          theoretical_flip_prob_bound: 0.083\n          empirical_flip_rate: 0.012\n          tightness_ratio: 6.9\n        eps_001:\n          theoretical_flip_prob_bound: 0.167\n          empirical_flip_rate: 0.025\n          tightness_ratio: 6.7\n        eps_002:\n          theoretical_flip_prob_bound: 0.333\n          empirical_flip_rate: 0.058\n          tightness_ratio: 5.7\n        eps_005:\n          theoretical_flip_prob_bound: 0.834\n          empirical_flip_rate: 0.148\n          tightness_ratio: 5.6\n        eps_01:\n          theoretical_flip_prob_bound: 1.0\n          empirical_flip_rate: 0.312\n          tightness_ratio: \"N/A (bound saturated)\"\n      avg_tightness_ratio: 6.2\n      bound_direction_correct: true\n      bound_never_violated: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 bound_tightness_ratio 在 [5.0, 10.0]。Formal bound P(flip) ≤ k·ε·L/Δ_k\n      使用的是 worst-case Lipschitz constant（spectral norm 1.07）和 median margin（0.93），但实际\n      扰动下的 importance score 变化远小于 worst case——因为 (a) spectral norm 是所有方向的上界，实际\n      扰动方向大多不沿最大奇异值方向；(b) Δ_k 是 median 但很多 token 的 margin 远大于 median。因此\n      theoretical bound 是 empirical rate 的 ~6x——方向正确（bound 从未被违反），但 loose 程度会让\n      追求 tight guarantee 的审稿人不满。\n      ε=0.1 时 theoretical bound 饱和到 1.0（trivial bound），此时 empirical rate 0.312 说明实际\n      还有很大空间——bound 在高扰动下失去指导价值。\n      论文应将 bound 定位为 \"principled design criterion that correctly ranks training objectives\"\n      而非 \"tight runtime certificate\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Theoretical vs Empirical Bound (SmolVLA, k=145)\"\n        columns: [\"ε\", \"Theoretical P(flip)\", \"Empirical flip rate\", \"Tightness ratio\", \"Bound holds?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.005\", \"0.083\", \"0.012\", \"6.9x\", \"✓\"]\n          - [\"0.010\", \"0.167\", \"0.025\", \"6.7x\", \"✓\"]\n          - [\"0.020\", \"0.333\", \"0.058\", \"5.7x\", \"✓\"]\n          - [\"0.050\", \"0.834\", \"0.148\", \"5.6x\", \"✓\"]\n          - [\"0.100\", \"1.000\", \"0.312\", \"—\", \"✓ (trivial)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Log-log plot: x 轴 ε，y 轴 flip probability。两条线：theoretical bound (上方虚线) 和 empirical rate (下方实线 + error bars)。两线平行但间隔 ~6x，在 ε=0.1 处 theoretical 线碰顶。shaded area 表示 'certified safe zone'。\"\n      - \"Tightness ratio vs ε: bar chart，显示 ratio 在 5.6~6.9 范围，标注 median 档 target [5, 10]。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Bound 从未被违反（soundness 成立），但 5.6~6.9x 的 tightness ratio 意味着 bound 提供的是\n      conservative certificate。审稿人可能的反应：\"bound 太 loose，实际指导价值有限\"。应对策略：\n      (1) 强调 bound 的 comparative value——IMM 训练后 Δ_k 从 0.01 提升到 0.93（93x），即使 bound\n      是 6x loose，认证区域仍扩大了 93/6 ≈ 15x；\n      (2) 强调 bound 作为 training objective design principle 的价值——最大化 Δ_k 的动机来自 bound，\n      实验证明这个方向正确；\n      (3) 承认 tightening bound 是 future work（可能通过 data-dependent Lipschitz 估计）。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Compression Validation (IMM + FastV/VLA-IAP/VLA-Cache)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      IMM 叠加到 FastV、VLA-IAP、VLA-Cache 三种现有压缩方法上，对比各方法 baseline vs +IMM 的鲁棒性。\n    expected_results:\n      fastv:\n        baseline_eps001_preservation: 0.36\n        imm_eps001_preservation: 0.89\n        baseline_G3: 1.00\n        imm_G3: 0.94\n        preservation_gain_pp: 53.0\n      vla_iap:\n        baseline_eps001_preservation: 0.38\n        imm_eps001_preservation: 0.90\n        baseline_G3: 1.00\n        imm_G3: 0.97\n        preservation_gain_pp: 52.0\n      vla_cache:\n        baseline_eps001_preservation: 0.33\n        imm_eps001_preservation: 0.88\n        baseline_G3: 1.00\n        imm_G3: 1.02\n        preservation_gain_pp: 55.0\n      avg_preservation_gain_pp: 53.3\n      avg_G3_with_imm: 0.98\n      cross_method_margin_ratio_range: [18, 45]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 cross_model_margin_ratio 在 [15, 50]。IMM 训练的 margin maximization 是在\n      ACIS importance scoring 上进行的，与下游具体用哪种压缩方法无关——ACIS 训练完成后，FastV/VLA-IAP/\n      VLA-Cache 各自用自己的 token selection 策略，但 IMM 训练过的 backbone 对 token importance\n      分布本身已经被 restructured（高重要性 token 的 score 与低重要性 token 拉开了更大间距）。因此\n      不管用哪种 selection 策略，被选中/被丢弃的 token 集合在扰动下更稳定。\n      G3 接近 1.0（0.94~1.02）因为 IMM two-stage 对 backbone 的修改是通过 Stage2 LoRA 完成的，\n      影响范围有限，不会严重干扰其他压缩方法的工作方式。VLA-Cache 的 G3 略>1.0 因为它的 KV-cache\n      eviction 策略本身就不依赖 token importance scoring，IMM 的修改对它影响最小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: IMM as Plugin for Existing Compression Methods\"\n        columns: [\"Compression Method\", \"Pres. (baseline)\", \"Pres. (+IMM)\", \"Gain (pp)\", \"G3 (+IMM)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FastV\", \"0.36\", \"0.89\", \"+53\", \"0.94\"]\n          - [\"VLA-IAP\", \"0.38\", \"0.90\", \"+52\", \"0.97\"]\n          - [\"VLA-Cache\", \"0.33\", \"0.88\", \"+55\", \"1.02\"]\n          - [\"ACIS (ours)\", \"0.34\", \"0.90\", \"+56\", \"0.87\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 4 compression methods × 2 conditions (baseline vs +IMM)，y 轴 preservation rate。所有 baseline bars 在 0.33~0.38，所有 +IMM bars 在 0.88~0.90，形成强烈视觉对比。\"\n    analysis: >\n      IMM 对所有测试的压缩方法都提供 ~53pp 的 preservation rate 提升，G3 在 0.94~1.02 范围，证明\n      IMM 是 compression-agnostic 的训练策略。这是 paper 的一个 strong selling point——IMM 不是又一个\n      新压缩方法，而是一个可以叠加到任何现有方法上的 robustness layer。审稿人可能追问 overhead：\n      IMM 训练需要额外 Stage1，推理时需要 ACIS module——这由 plan_011 量化。\n\n  - name: \"Defense Comparison (IMM vs AT vs RS vs Jacobian Reg)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      IMM vs adversarial training vs randomized smoothing vs RobustVLA Jacobian regularization，\n      在 LIBERO 设置下标准+扰动条件的对比。\n    expected_results:\n      clean_success_rate:\n        baseline: 0.68\n        imm: 0.67\n        adversarial_training: 0.62\n        randomized_smoothing: 0.64\n        jacobian_reg: 0.66\n      perturbed_eps001_success_rate:\n        baseline: 0.51\n        imm: 0.63\n        adversarial_training: 0.59\n        randomized_smoothing: 0.56\n        jacobian_reg: 0.57\n      perturbed_eps005_success_rate:\n        baseline: 0.32\n        imm: 0.48\n        adversarial_training: 0.46\n        randomized_smoothing: 0.41\n        jacobian_reg: 0.42\n      training_overhead_relative:\n        imm: 1.3\n        adversarial_training: 3.2\n        randomized_smoothing: 1.0\n        jacobian_reg: 1.8\n      compression_compatible:\n        imm: true\n        adversarial_training: false\n        randomized_smoothing: false\n        jacobian_reg: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      IMM 在 perturbed 条件下优于其他方法但优势不大（+4~7pp vs AT, +7~12pp vs RS/JR），在 clean\n      条件下几乎无损（-1pp）。AT 在 clean 上损失最多（-6pp），因为 adversarial training 的 min-max\n      优化牺牲了 clean performance 换 robust performance——经典的 accuracy-robustness tradeoff。\n      RS 的 clean 损失来自 inference-time noise injection 的 variance。JR 的损失来自 Jacobian\n      约束限制了模型表达能力。\n      IMM 的独特优势不在于 robustness 绝对值（与 AT 接近），而在于 (1) 几乎不损失 clean performance，\n      (2) 兼容 token compression（其他方法都不提供 compression），(3) 训练开销较低（1.3x vs AT 的 3.2x）。\n      这是 Pareto improvement 叙事的核心支撑。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Defense Method Comparison (LIBERO-avg)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Clean SR\", \"ε=0.01 SR\", \"ε=0.05 SR\", \"Train Cost\", \"Compression?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Baseline\", \"68%\", \"51%\", \"32%\", \"1.0x\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"IMM (ours)\", \"67%\", \"63%\", \"48%\", \"1.3x\", \"✓ 50%\"]\n          - [\"Adversarial Training\", \"62%\", \"59%\", \"46%\", \"3.2x\", \"✗\"]\n          - [\"Randomized Smoothing\", \"64%\", \"56%\", \"41%\", \"1.0x\", \"✗\"]\n          - [\"Jacobian Reg\", \"66%\", \"57%\", \"42%\", \"1.8x\", \"✗\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto front plot: x 轴 clean SR，y 轴 perturbed SR (ε=0.01)。IMM 在右上角（高 clean + 高 robust），AT 在左上偏下（低 clean + medium robust），RS/JR 在中间。标注 IMM 为 Pareto optimal。\"\n    analysis: >\n      IMM 是唯一同时提供 compression + robustness 且 clean performance 几乎无损的方法。但优势幅度不大\n      （vs AT 仅 +4pp @ε=0.01），审稿人可能认为 \"AT 不需要 ACIS 模块更简单\"。应对：强调 IMM 是\n      compression-aware defense（场景不同），且训练成本仅 1.3x（AT 需 3.2x）。在 median 档下这个结果\n      足以 support \"Pareto improvement\" claim 但不足以声称 \"dominant defense\"。\n\n  - name: \"Pruning Ratio Sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      k_ratio = 0.3/0.4/0.5/0.6/0.7/0.8/0.9 下 G3 deploy ratio 曲线，找最优压缩点。\n    expected_results:\n      ratio_030:\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 1.18\n        action_loss: 0.0048\n        eps001_preservation: 0.92\n      ratio_040:\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 1.03\n        action_loss: 0.0042\n        eps001_preservation: 0.91\n      ratio_050:\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.87\n        action_loss: 0.0035\n        eps001_preservation: 0.90\n      ratio_060:\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.83\n        action_loss: 0.0034\n        eps001_preservation: 0.89\n      ratio_070:\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.89\n        action_loss: 0.0036\n        eps001_preservation: 0.88\n      ratio_080:\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.95\n        action_loss: 0.0039\n        eps001_preservation: 0.87\n      ratio_090:\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.99\n        action_loss: 0.0040\n        eps001_preservation: 0.86\n      optimal_ratio: 0.60\n      sweet_spot_range: [0.50, 0.70]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Pruning ratio sweep 展示一个 U-shaped G3 curve：\n      - ratio 0.3 (保留 30% token): 过度压缩，丢弃了部分有用 token，G3=1.18（18% degradation）。\n      - ratio 0.4~0.5: 进入 sweet spot，denoising effect 开始主导——删除的 token 主要是低信息量的，\n        删除它们减少了 action prediction 中的 noise source。G3<1.0。\n      - ratio 0.6: 最优点 G3=0.83，保留 60% token 时 denoising 效果最强——足够的 token 被删除来\n        产生 denoising，但没多到丢失关键信息。\n      - ratio 0.7~0.9: 删除太少 token，denoising 效果减弱（fewer noise tokens removed），G3 逐渐\n        回到 1.0。\n      Preservation rate 随 ratio 增大单调微降（0.92→0.86），因为保留更多 token 意味着更多 borderline\n      token 被包含，这些 token 的 importance score 接近 threshold，更容易被扰动翻转。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Pruning Ratio Sweep (SmolVLA, aloha_sim_insertion)\"\n        columns: [\"Keep Ratio\", \"Action Loss\", \"G3 Ratio\", \"ε=0.01 Pres.\", \"Tokens Kept\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.30\", \"0.0048\", \"1.18\", \"0.92\", \"87/290\"]\n          - [\"0.40\", \"0.0042\", \"1.03\", \"0.91\", \"116/290\"]\n          - [\"0.50\", \"0.0035\", \"0.87\", \"0.90\", \"145/290\"]\n          - [\"0.60\", \"0.0034\", \"0.83\", \"0.89\", \"174/290\"]\n          - [\"0.70\", \"0.0036\", \"0.89\", \"0.88\", \"203/290\"]\n          - [\"0.80\", \"0.0039\", \"0.95\", \"0.87\", \"232/290\"]\n          - [\"0.90\", \"0.0040\", \"0.99\", \"0.86\", \"261/290\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dual y-axis line plot: x 轴 keep ratio (0.3→0.9)，左 y 轴 G3 ratio (U-shaped curve, min at 0.6)，右 y 轴 preservation rate (gentle downward slope)。horizontal dashed line at G3=1.0。Green shading for 'denoising zone' (G3<1.0)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      U-shape curve 支持 denoising hypothesis——存在一个 sweet spot (0.5~0.7) 在该范围内 compression\n      is beneficial。但这不是 conclusive evidence：同样的 U-shape 可能由 regularization effect（类似\n      dropout）解释，不一定是 \"removing noisy tokens\"。论文应将此作为 \"empirical observation consistent\n      with denoising hypothesis\" 而非 strong causal claim。最优点在 0.6 而非 0.5 说明 paper 中使用的\n      50% 不是最优选择——但 0.5 是更标准的比较点，且 G3=0.87 已经 <1.0。\n\n  - name: \"Token Importance Analysis (Attention & Gradient)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      分析被 ACIS 删除 vs 保留 token 的 attention weight 分布、与 action prediction 的 gradient 相关性。\n    expected_results:\n      pruned_token_avg_attn_weight: 0.0018\n      kept_token_avg_attn_weight: 0.0041\n      attn_weight_ratio: 0.44\n      pruned_token_avg_grad_norm: 0.0012\n      kept_token_avg_grad_norm: 0.0038\n      grad_norm_ratio: 0.32\n      attn_weight_ks_test_p: 0.003\n      grad_norm_ks_test_p: 0.008\n      cohen_d_attn: 0.42\n      cohen_d_grad: 0.51\n      spearman_importance_vs_attn: 0.38\n      spearman_importance_vs_grad: 0.45\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 pruned_token_attn_weight_ratio 在 [0.3, 0.6]。被 ACIS 标记为低重要性并删除的\n      token 在 action decoder 的 cross-attention 中确实接收更少 attention（ratio 0.44）——这些 token\n      携带的信息对 action prediction 贡献较小。Gradient norm ratio 0.32 也支持这一点——被删除 token\n      对 action loss 的梯度贡献更小。\n      但 effect size 中等（Cohen's d = 0.42~0.51），不是大效应（d>0.8）。这意味着分布有 overlap——\n      部分被删除的 token 的 attention weight 其实不低，部分被保留的 token 的 attention weight 也不高。\n      ACIS 学到的 importance 与 attention/gradient 有中等正相关（Spearman 0.38~0.45），说明 ACIS\n      捕捉了部分但非全部的 task-relevance 信号。\n      这足以支持 \"consistent with denoising hypothesis\" 但不够强到作为独立 claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Token Analysis — Pruned vs Kept\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Pruned Tokens\", \"Kept Tokens\", \"Ratio\", \"Cohen's d\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Avg Attention Weight\", \"0.0018\", \"0.0041\", \"0.44\", \"0.42\", \"0.003\"]\n          - [\"Avg Gradient Norm\", \"0.0012\", \"0.0038\", \"0.32\", \"0.51\", \"0.008\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Violin plot (split): 左半 pruned tokens、右半 kept tokens，y 轴 attention weight。Kept 分布重心更高但有 overlap。标注 Cohen's d 和 p-value。\"\n      - \"Scatter plot: x 轴 ACIS importance score，y 轴 action-head attention weight，每点一个 token (subsample 1000)。标注 Spearman ρ=0.38。颜色编码 pruned (red) vs kept (blue)，分界线处有明显混合。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Token analysis 提供 \"部分证据\" 支持 denoising 假设：被删除 token 确实平均而言 task-relevance 更低，\n      但 effect size 中等且分布有 overlap。这不足以排除其他解释（如 regularization/implicit ensemble）。\n      论文中应呈现为 supplementary analysis，措辞为 \"the attention and gradient analysis is consistent\n      with an importance-guided denoising interpretation, though the moderate effect sizes suggest\n      additional mechanisms may contribute\"。审稿人可能接受这个 level 的 evidence 用于 analysis section，\n      但如果放在 core contribution 中会被质疑不够 conclusive。\n\n  - name: \"v8c Annealing Ablation (mask ratio 0.9→0.5)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      Mask ratio annealing (0.9→0.5 during Stage1) vs two-stage 固定 0.5 对比。已在 cuda:0 运行中。\n    expected_results:\n      v8c_annealing:\n        acis_prune50_action_loss: 0.0038\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.93\n        margin_median: 0.85\n        eps001_preservation: 0.91\n        training_stability: \"smoother convergence curve\"\n      v8b_fixed:\n        acis_prune50_action_loss: 0.0035\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.87\n        margin_median: 0.93\n        eps001_preservation: 0.90\n        training_stability: \"slight oscillation in early steps\"\n      delta_G3: 0.06\n      delta_margin: -0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      Annealing (0.9→0.5) 在 Stage1 早期让 ACIS 看到几乎所有 token（mask ratio 0.9 = keep 90%），\n      逐步增加压缩难度。这产生更平滑的训练曲线但最终 margin 略低于固定 0.5——因为 ACIS 在早期 \"easy\"\n      阶段学到了较宽松的 importance 分布，切换到 0.5 时需要 re-sharpen，但训练结束前可能不完全收敛。\n      G3=0.93 vs 0.87，annealing 版本的 denoising effect 更弱（删除的 token 不如固定 0.5 版本\n      那么 confidently low-importance）。两者差距不大（0.06），annealing 的价值更多在训练稳定性\n      而非最终性能。论文可能只在 appendix 中提及。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Annealing vs Fixed Mask Ratio\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"Action Loss\", \"G3\", \"Margin\", \"ε=0.01 Pres.\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Fixed 0.5 (v8b)\", \"0.0035\", \"0.87\", \"0.93\", \"0.90\"]\n          - [\"Anneal 0.9→0.5 (v8c)\", \"0.0038\", \"0.93\", \"0.85\", \"0.91\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Training loss curve comparison: 两条线（v8b vs v8c），x 轴 step，y 轴 Stage1 loss。v8c 更平滑但最终略高。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Annealing 不优于固定 mask ratio，主要价值在于训练稳定性。在 median 档下两者差距不大（G3 差 0.06），\n      paper 应以 v8b（固定 0.5）为主结果，annealing 作为 ablation 放 appendix。这也暗示 mask ratio\n      的选择不是 critical hyperparameter——在合理范围内结果 robust。\n\n  - name: \"ACIS Overhead Quantification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      ACIS 模块的参数量、FLOPs、推理延迟测量。证明部署成本可忽略。\n    expected_results:\n      acis_params_M: 2.3\n      backbone_params_M: 500\n      param_overhead_pct: 0.46\n      acis_flops_G: 0.18\n      backbone_flops_G: 45.2\n      flop_overhead_pct: 0.40\n      inference_latency_ms_without_acis: 42.5\n      inference_latency_ms_with_acis: 43.1\n      latency_overhead_ms: 0.6\n      latency_overhead_pct: 1.4\n      throughput_tokens_per_sec_without: 6800\n      throughput_tokens_per_sec_with_compression: 11200\n      throughput_gain_pct: 64.7\n      net_speedup_with_50pct_compression: 1.62\n    result_rationale: >\n      ACIS 是一个 lightweight cross-attention module（2~3M params），相对于 SmolVLA 的 500M backbone\n      开销 <0.5%。推理时 ACIS 只需要一次 forward pass 来产生 importance scores，然后 top-k selection\n      是 O(n log n) 的排序操作——latency 几乎可忽略（+0.6ms）。\n      但 ACIS 带来的 50% token compression 使后续 transformer 层的计算量大幅减少（attention 是 O(n²)，\n      token 减半意味着 attention 计算减少 75%，但只有 decoder 部分受益），净 throughput 提升约 64%。\n      这意味着 ACIS 的 overhead 被 compression 的效率增益远远补偿——实际上是 net positive。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: ACIS Deployment Overhead\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Without ACIS\", \"With ACIS+Compress\", \"Overhead/Gain\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Parameters\", \"500M\", \"502.3M\", \"+0.46%\"]\n          - [\"FLOPs per step\", \"45.2G\", \"27.6G\", \"-39% (net)\"]\n          - [\"Latency (ms)\", \"42.5\", \"26.8\", \"-37% (net)\"]\n          - [\"Throughput (tok/s)\", \"6800\", \"11200\", \"+64.7%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: 左 bar 为 without ACIS (full tokens)，右 bar 为 with ACIS+compression，分段颜色表示 ACIS overhead (tiny red slice) 和 compression saving (large green reduction)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      ACIS overhead 几乎可忽略（<0.5% params, +0.6ms latency），而 50% compression 带来 ~37% latency\n      reduction 和 65% throughput gain。这有效回应 RC4——ACIS 不是 deployment burden 而是 deployment\n      accelerator。论文应将此呈现为 \"ACIS adds negligible overhead while enabling substantial inference\n      speedup through principled compression\"。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO-Plus 7-Dimension Perturbation Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      IMM+compression 在 LIBERO-Plus 7 维扰动（camera, lighting, texture, distractors, table color,\n      scene structure, combined）上的 success rate 评估。Headline result 所需的完整鲁棒性评估。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_no_compress:\n        camera: 0.58\n        lighting: 0.61\n        texture: 0.55\n        distractors: 0.52\n        table_color: 0.63\n        scene_structure: 0.48\n        combined: 0.35\n        clean: 0.68\n      baseline_compress50:\n        camera: 0.41\n        lighting: 0.45\n        texture: 0.39\n        distractors: 0.36\n        table_color: 0.47\n        scene_structure: 0.33\n        combined: 0.20\n        clean: 0.67\n      imm_compress50:\n        camera: 0.55\n        lighting: 0.59\n        texture: 0.52\n        distractors: 0.49\n        table_color: 0.61\n        scene_structure: 0.45\n        combined: 0.31\n        clean: 0.67\n      imm_vs_baseline_compress_avg_gain_pp: 14.3\n      imm_vs_baseline_nocompress_avg_loss_pp: -2.6\n      headline_template_fill:\n        benchmark: \"LIBERO\"\n        X_success: \"67%\"\n        Y_epsilon: \"camera+lighting+texture\"\n        Z_baseline_retain: \"40%\"\n        imm_retain: \"55%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      LIBERO-Plus 扰动直接改变视觉输入，测试 VLA 的感知鲁棒性。Baseline+compression 在扰动下严重退化\n      （clean 67% → combined 20%）因为 token compression 在扰动输入上的 importance ranking 不稳定——\n      扰动使关键 token 被误判为不重要而被删除。\n      IMM 训练后 compression 在扰动下表现显著改善（combined 31% vs 20%，+11pp），因为 margin 最大化\n      使 importance ranking 对输入扰动更稳定。但 IMM+compress 仍不如 baseline no-compress（31% vs 35%），\n      说明 compression 在 combined 极端扰动下仍有不可避免的信息损失。\n      在单维扰动上 IMM+compress 接近 baseline no-compress（差距 2~5pp），这是 median 档的核心结果：\n      IMM 使 compressed model 在常见扰动下的表现接近 uncompressed model，compression 的 robustness\n      cost 从 ~17pp 缩小到 ~3pp。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LIBERO-Plus 7-Dimension Robustness (Success Rate %)\"\n        columns: [\"Perturbation\", \"No Compress\", \"Compress 50%\", \"IMM+Compress 50%\", \"IMM Gain vs Compress\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Clean\", \"68\", \"67\", \"67\", \"+0\"]\n          - [\"Camera\", \"58\", \"41\", \"55\", \"+14\"]\n          - [\"Lighting\", \"61\", \"45\", \"59\", \"+14\"]\n          - [\"Texture\", \"55\", \"39\", \"52\", \"+13\"]\n          - [\"Distractors\", \"52\", \"36\", \"49\", \"+13\"]\n          - [\"Table Color\", \"63\", \"47\", \"61\", \"+14\"]\n          - [\"Scene Structure\", \"48\", \"33\", \"45\", \"+12\"]\n          - [\"Combined\", \"35\", \"20\", \"31\", \"+11\"]\n          - [\"Avg Perturbed\", \"53.1\", \"37.3\", \"50.3\", \"+13.0\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart: 7 axes (one per perturbation type)。三条线（no-compress: blue, compress: red, IMM+compress: green）。IMM+compress 线几乎与 no-compress 重叠（除 combined 维度外），compress 线明显内缩。\"\n      - \"Headline figure: 横向 bar chart，每个扰动类型三个 bar 上下排列，清晰展示 IMM 恢复了 compression 丢失的 robustness。\"\n    analysis: >\n      LIBERO-Plus 结果是 paper 的 headline result。核心 message：\"IMM closes the robustness gap between\n      compressed and uncompressed VLAs under realistic perturbations\"。在单维扰动下 IMM+compress 与\n      no-compress 仅差 ~3pp（平均），而 naive compression 差 ~16pp。Combined 扰动下差距更大（4pp vs 15pp）\n      但方向一致。\n      Headline 可写为：\"On LIBERO-Plus, IMM-trained SmolVLA achieves 50.3% average success under\n      50% token compression + visual perturbation, recovering 78% of the robustness lost by standard\n      compression (37.3% → 50.3% vs 53.1%), while providing the first certified robustness guarantee\n      for VLA token compression.\"\n      审稿人可能注意到 IMM+compress 仍不如 no-compress——这是诚实的 median 档结果，paper 不应声称\n      compression is free，而应强调 robustness-compression tradeoff 的 Pareto improvement。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12620,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":12620},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ad349d52-f73d-4c40-8303-08fdd9f7e4c9","uuid":"1b9c459a-b7d7-4e3f-bfcf-8edcc5bdb038"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":291726,"duration_api_ms":293085,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claim 2 降级为 'near-lossless compression with robustness guarantee'——不再强调 performance gain，改为强调\n  robustness-compression tradeoff 的 Pareto improvement。Claim 3 从独立 claim 降级为 'empirical\n  observation consistent with denoising hypothesis'，放入 analysis section 而非 core contribution。\n  Claim 1 certified bound 改为强调 'principled design criterion' 而非 'tight guarantee'——bound 的价值\n  在于指导训练目标设计而非运行时认证。Story 从 'provably robust + lossless' 调整为 'first robustness-aware\n  compression framework with theoretical grounding'。仍可投 CoRL 但需要补充 computational overhead\n  analysis 证明 practical value。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  - name: \"Success Rate Evaluation on aloha_sim_insertion\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_001\"\n    description: >\n      aloha_sim_insertion 上 baseline vs v8b+prune(50%) vs v8b bypass，50+ episodes 对比 success rate。\n      验证 action loss 差异是否反映在实际任务表现上。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_success_rate: 0.82\n      v8b_prune50_success_rate: 0.84\n      v8b_bypass_success_rate: 0.80\n      random_prune50_success_rate: 0.54\n      n_episodes: 60\n      success_rate_delta_prune_vs_baseline_pp: 2.0\n      success_rate_delta_bypass_vs_baseline_pp: -2.0\n      p_value_prune_vs_baseline: 0.38\n      p_value_random_vs_baseline: 0.001\n      confidence_interval_95_prune: [0.73, 0.92]\n      confidence_interval_95_baseline: [0.71, 0.90]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 success_rate_delta 在 [-3, +4] pp 范围内。v8b+prune(50%) 的 action loss\n      (0.0035) 显著低于 baseline (0.0041)，但 action loss 差异为 ~15%，在 sim rollout 中这种差异\n      被环境随机性和 closed-loop 误差修正机制所稀释——机器人在多数 timestep 上都有足够的 action 质量完成任务，\n      因此 success rate 差异被压缩到统计不显著的 +2pp。Random prune 的 action loss (0.018) 是 baseline\n      的 4.4x，这种程度的 degradation 在 closed-loop 中无法被修正，success rate 大幅下降到 54%。\n      60 episode 的样本量在 ±2pp 的差异上 power 不足（需要 ~2000 episodes 才能 detect），因此 p>0.05。\n      这意味着论文不能声称 \"compression improves success rate\"，只能说 \"compression is near-lossless\n      in task performance while providing robustness guarantee\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Success Rate Comparison (aloha_sim_insertion, 60 episodes)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Success Rate\", \"95% CI\", \"p vs baseline\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Baseline (no compression)\", \"82%\", \"[71%, 90%]\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"IMM two-stage + ACIS prune 50%\", \"84%\", \"[73%, 92%]\", \"0.38\"]\n          - [\"IMM two-stage bypass (no prune)\", \"80%\", \"[68%, 89%]\", \"0.52\"]\n          - [\"Random prune 50%\", \"54%\", \"[41%, 66%]\", \"0.001\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bar chart with 95% CI error bars: 4 conditions, y-axis success rate 0-100%。前三个 bar 高度接近且 CI 重叠，random prune 明显低。标注 n.s. (not significant) 在 baseline vs ACIS prune 之间。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Success rate 方向一致但差异不显著（p=0.38），符合 median 档预期。这支持 'near-lossless' 叙事但不支持\n      'performance gain' 叙事。Random prune 的显著下降（-28pp, p<0.001）证明 ACIS importance scoring\n      是必要的——不是任意 50% 都能删。论文应呈现为 \"ACIS-guided compression preserves task success while\n      random compression catastrophically degrades\"。审稿人可能要求更多 episodes 或更多 tasks 来增强统计\n      power，这由 plan_002 (LIBERO) 部分解决。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO Benchmark Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_002\"\n    description: >\n      SmolVLA+IMM two-stage 在 LIBERO-Object/Spatial/Goal 三个 suite 上训练+评估，对比 baseline。\n      每 suite 10 tasks × 20 episodes = 200 episodes per suite。\n    expected_results:\n      libero_object:\n        baseline_success_rate: 0.76\n        imm_prune50_success_rate: 0.74\n        delta_pp: -2.0\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.95\n      libero_spatial:\n        baseline_success_rate: 0.68\n        imm_prune50_success_rate: 0.70\n        delta_pp: 2.0\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.92\n      libero_goal:\n        baseline_success_rate: 0.61\n        imm_prune50_success_rate: 0.59\n        delta_pp: -2.0\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 1.04\n      libero_avg_G3_deploy_ratio: 0.97\n      libero_avg_success_delta_pp: -0.7\n      p_value_paired_across_tasks: 0.31\n      eps001_preservation_avg: 0.91\n      margin_ratio_avg: 78.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 G3_deploy_ratio_libero_avg 在 [0.9, 1.05]。LIBERO 是比 aloha_sim_insertion\n      更复杂的多任务 benchmark，SmolVLA 在 LIBERO 上的 baseline 表现本身就不如 aloha（更多 task 多样性\n      和更长 horizon），因此 two-stage training 的增益被任务复杂度稀释。部分 task 上 G3<1.0（Object、Spatial\n      的 action loss 下降），部分 task 上 G3>1.0（Goal suite 的长 horizon 任务中 pruning 偶尔丢弃\n      长期规划相关 token），整体平均在 0.97 左右——接近无损但不是所有 task 都无损。\n      Success rate 差异在各 suite 上方向不一致（Object -2pp, Spatial +2pp, Goal -2pp），平均 -0.7pp，\n      paired test p=0.31 不显著。这进一步支持 'near-lossless' 而非 'improvement' 叙事。\n      Robustness 指标（preservation 0.91, margin ratio 78.5x）在 LIBERO 上依然显著优于 baseline，\n      说明 IMM 的 robustness benefit 跨 benchmark 泛化。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LIBERO Suite Results (SmolVLA, 50% compression)\"\n        columns: [\"Suite\", \"Baseline SR\", \"IMM+Prune SR\", \"Δpp\", \"G3 ratio\", \"ε=0.01 Pres.\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"LIBERO-Object\", \"76%\", \"74%\", \"-2\", \"0.95\", \"0.92\"]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Spatial\", \"68%\", \"70%\", \"+2\", \"0.92\", \"0.90\"]\n          - [\"LIBERO-Goal\", \"61%\", \"59%\", \"-2\", \"1.04\", \"0.91\"]\n          - [\"Average\", \"68.3%\", \"67.7%\", \"-0.7\", \"0.97\", \"0.91\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Per-task G3 ratio heatmap: 30 tasks (10 per suite) × G3 值，用颜色编码 <0.95 (green) / 0.95-1.05 (yellow) / >1.05 (red)。预期大部分为 yellow，少数 green，1-2 个 red。\"\n      - \"Robustness improvement bar chart: 每 suite 的 preservation rate（baseline ~0.34 vs IMM ~0.91）并排 bar。\"\n    analysis: >\n      LIBERO 结果验证 two-stage 跨 benchmark 有效但效果不如 aloha_sim_insertion 上明显。G3 ratio 在\n      0.92~1.04 范围，平均 0.97，部分 task 低于 1（支持 denoising 假设但不普遍），部分略高于 1（压缩有微小\n      代价）。Success rate 差异不显著，整体叙事为 \"near-lossless compression + significant robustness\n      gain across benchmarks\"。审稿人可能注意到 Goal suite 上 G3>1.0 的趋势——需在论文中讨论长 horizon 任务\n      中 token importance 分布可能需要 task-adaptive pruning ratio。\n\n  - name: \"OpenVLA Model Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_003\"\n    description: >\n      IMM two-stage 在 OpenVLA (7B) 上复现，LIBERO 数据集。验证跨模型泛化性。\n    expected_results:\n      openvla_libero_object:\n        baseline_action_loss: 0.0032\n        imm_prune50_action_loss: 0.0035\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 1.09\n      openvla_libero_spatial:\n        baseline_action_loss: 0.0038\n        imm_prune50_action_loss: 0.0042\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 1.11\n      openvla_libero_goal:\n        baseline_action_loss: 0.0045\n        imm_prune50_action_loss: 0.0050\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 1.11\n      openvla_avg_G3_deploy_ratio: 1.10\n      openvla_margin_ratio: 32.5\n      openvla_eps001_preservation: 0.89\n      openvla_success_rate_delta_pp: -1.5\n      training_gpu_hours: 55\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 G3_deploy_ratio_openvla 在 [1.0, 1.15]。OpenVLA 是 7B 模型，baseline 本身\n      的 action prediction 质量更高（loss 更低），因此 pruning 带来的 denoising 效应被更强的 backbone\n      能力所稀释——大模型的 token representation 本身冗余度更低（每个 token 携带更多非冗余信息），pruning\n      50% 时不可避免地丢弃部分有用信息。G3 ratio 1.10 意味着压缩后 action loss 上升 10%——不再 lossless\n      但 degradation 可控（success rate 仅降 1.5pp，在统计噪声内）。\n      Margin ratio 32.5x（vs SmolVLA 93x）也反映了大模型上 IMM 的效果衰减——7B 模型的 LoRA 微调\n      可能不足以让 ACIS margin 被充分优化（LoRA rank 限制了优化自由度）。但 preservation 0.89 仍远优于\n      baseline 的 ~0.34，robustness benefit 依然显著。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Cross-Model Comparison (LIBERO-Object, 50% compression)\"\n        columns: [\"Model\", \"Params\", \"Baseline Loss\", \"IMM+Prune Loss\", \"G3\", \"Margin Ratio\", \"Pres. ε=0.01\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"SmolVLA\", \"0.5B\", \"0.0041\", \"0.0035\", \"0.87\", \"93.2x\", \"0.90\"]\n          - [\"OpenVLA\", \"7B\", \"0.0032\", \"0.0035\", \"1.09\", \"32.5x\", \"0.89\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"G3 ratio vs model size scatter plot (2 points + trend line): 显示 G3 随模型增大从 <1.0 上升到 >1.0 的趋势。\"\n      - \"Margin ratio vs model size: 显示 IMM 对 margin 的提升随模型增大而减弱。\"\n    analysis: >\n      OpenVLA 结果证实 two-stage 方法跨模型可行但效果减弱。G3=1.10 意味着论文不能声称 \"lossless compression\n      on all models\"，需要改为 \"near-lossless on small models, controllable degradation on large models\"。\n      关键 insight：大模型 token 冗余度低，denoising effect 消失，但 robustness benefit 仍然存在\n      （preservation 0.89 vs 0.34）。论文叙事需要强调 robustness-compression tradeoff 的 Pareto\n      improvement 而非 free lunch。审稿人可能追问：是否可以通过调整 pruning ratio 到 30% 在 OpenVLA\n      上恢复 lossless？这由 plan_008 的 ratio sweep 部分回答。\n\n  - name: \"Training Ablation: Joint vs Gradient-Isolated vs Two-Stage\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_004\"\n    description: >\n      Joint (v7 style) vs gradient-isolated (v8 style) vs two-stage (v8b style) 三路对比，\n      统一超参，消除 confounding factors。\n    expected_results:\n      joint_v7:\n        clean_action_loss: 0.0134\n        acis_prune50_action_loss: 0.0134\n        bypass_action_loss: 0.0078\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 3.29\n        margin_median: 0.57\n        eps001_preservation: 0.91\n        diagnosis: backbone_damaged_by_coadaptation\n      gradient_isolated_v8:\n        clean_action_loss: 0.0055\n        acis_prune50_action_loss: 0.0055\n        bypass_action_loss: 0.0289\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 1.34\n        margin_median: 0.50\n        eps001_preservation: 0.92\n        diagnosis: partial_coadaptation_residual\n      two_stage_v8b:\n        clean_action_loss: 0.0207\n        acis_prune50_action_loss: 0.0035\n        bypass_action_loss: 0.0187\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.87\n        margin_median: 0.93\n        eps001_preservation: 0.90\n        diagnosis: clean_separation\n      baseline_ref:\n        clean_action_loss: 0.0041\n    result_rationale: >\n      三种训练策略的根本差异在于 ACIS 和 backbone 之间的信息流隔离程度：\n      (1) Joint (v7): ACIS 和 backbone 同时训练，backbone 适应 ACIS 的 mask pattern，导致 backbone\n      单独运行时性能崩溃（bypass loss 仅 0.0078 ≪ standard loss 0.0134，说明 backbone 在 co-adaptation\n      中学到了 \"依赖 ACIS\"的模式）。G3=3.29 表明不加 ACIS 几乎无法使用。\n      (2) Gradient-isolated (v8): 阻断了 ACIS→backbone 的梯度流，但 backbone 仍然在有 ACIS mask\n      的环境中训练，产生隐式 co-adaptation。G3=1.34——比 joint 好很多但仍非无损。\n      (3) Two-stage (v8b): Stage1 完全冻结 backbone 训 ACIS，Stage2 完全冻结 ACIS 训 LoRA。\n      两者从未同时优化，消除所有 co-adaptation。G3=0.87，backbone 质量最接近原始 baseline。\n      这个 ablation 是论文的核心工程贡献——解释了为什么 two-stage 是必要的。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Training Strategy Ablation (SmolVLA, aloha_sim_insertion)\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"Standard Loss\", \"ACIS+Prune Loss\", \"Bypass Loss\", \"G3 Ratio\", \"Margin\", \"ε=0.01 Pres.\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Joint (v7)\", \"0.0134\", \"0.0134\", \"0.0078\", \"3.29\", \"0.57\", \"0.91\"]\n          - [\"Grad-Isolated (v8)\", \"0.0055\", \"0.0055\", \"0.0289\", \"1.34\", \"0.50\", \"0.92\"]\n          - [\"Two-Stage (v8b)\", \"0.0207\", \"0.0035\", \"0.0187\", \"0.87\", \"0.93\", \"0.90\"]\n          - [\"Baseline (no IMM)\", \"0.0041\", \"—\", \"—\", \"1.00\", \"0.01\", \"0.34\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"三行子图：每行一个训练策略，x 轴为 training step，y 轴为 action loss。每行画 3 条线（standard / ACIS+prune / bypass），直观展示 co-adaptation 的不同模式。Joint: standard 和 bypass 交叉；Grad-isolated: bypass 高于 standard 但差距不大；Two-stage: 两段 plateau 明显，最终 ACIS+prune 远低于其他。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Ablation 清晰展示 co-adaptation 问题的机制和 two-stage 的解决方案。Joint 训练中 bypass loss 极低\n      说明 backbone 被 ACIS 的 mask pattern 结构性改变——这不是 \"improved backbone\" 而是 \"broken backbone\n      that depends on ACIS\"。Gradient isolation 部分解决但不彻底（G3=1.34 仍>1.0）。Two-stage 完全解决，\n      代价是训练流程更复杂（需要两阶段、冻结策略）。论文应将此呈现为 key engineering contribution，类似 BatchNorm\n      需要 running mean/var 分离一样，ACIS 需要训练解耦来保证 backbone 完整性。\n\n  - name: \"Formal Bound Empirical Validation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_005\"\n    description: >\n      多 ε 水平 (0.005, 0.01, 0.02, 0.05, 0.1) 下测量 top-k stability，绘制 theoretical vs\n      empirical bound 对比图。估计 Lipschitz constant L via spectral norm。\n    expected_results:\n      lipschitz_spectral_norm: 1.07\n      margin_median: 0.93\n      k: 145\n      eps_levels:\n        eps_0005:\n          theoretical_flip_prob_bound: 0.083\n          empirical_flip_rate: 0.012\n          tightness_ratio: 6.9\n        eps_001:\n          theoretical_flip_prob_bound: 0.167\n          empirical_flip_rate: 0.025\n          tightness_ratio: 6.7\n        eps_002:\n          theoretical_flip_prob_bound: 0.333\n          empirical_flip_rate: 0.058\n          tightness_ratio: 5.7\n        eps_005:\n          theoretical_flip_prob_bound: 0.834\n          empirical_flip_rate: 0.148\n          tightness_ratio: 5.6\n        eps_01:\n          theoretical_flip_prob_bound: 1.0\n          empirical_flip_rate: 0.312\n          tightness_ratio: \"N/A (bound saturated)\"\n      avg_tightness_ratio: 6.2\n      bound_direction_correct: true\n      bound_never_violated: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 bound_tightness_ratio 在 [5.0, 10.0]。Formal bound P(flip) ≤ k·ε·L/Δ_k\n      使用的是 worst-case Lipschitz constant（spectral norm 1.07）和 median margin（0.93），但实际\n      扰动下的 importance score 变化远小于 worst case——因为 (a) spectral norm 是所有方向的上界，实际\n      扰动方向大多不沿最大奇异值方向；(b) Δ_k 是 median 但很多 token 的 margin 远大于 median。因此\n      theoretical bound 是 empirical rate 的 ~6x——方向正确（bound 从未被违反），但 loose 程度会让\n      追求 tight guarantee 的审稿人不满。\n      ε=0.1 时 theoretical bound 饱和到 1.0（trivial bound），此时 empirical rate 0.312 说明实际\n      还有很大空间——bound 在高扰动下失去指导价值。\n      论文应将 bound 定位为 \"principled design criterion that correctly ranks training objectives\"\n      而非 \"tight runtime certificate\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Theoretical vs Empirical Bound (SmolVLA, k=145)\"\n        columns: [\"ε\", \"Theoretical P(flip)\", \"Empirical flip rate\", \"Tightness ratio\", \"Bound holds?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.005\", \"0.083\", \"0.012\", \"6.9x\", \"✓\"]\n          - [\"0.010\", \"0.167\", \"0.025\", \"6.7x\", \"✓\"]\n          - [\"0.020\", \"0.333\", \"0.058\", \"5.7x\", \"✓\"]\n          - [\"0.050\", \"0.834\", \"0.148\", \"5.6x\", \"✓\"]\n          - [\"0.100\", \"1.000\", \"0.312\", \"—\", \"✓ (trivial)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Log-log plot: x 轴 ε，y 轴 flip probability。两条线：theoretical bound (上方虚线) 和 empirical rate (下方实线 + error bars)。两线平行但间隔 ~6x，在 ε=0.1 处 theoretical 线碰顶。shaded area 表示 'certified safe zone'。\"\n      - \"Tightness ratio vs ε: bar chart，显示 ratio 在 5.6~6.9 范围，标注 median 档 target [5, 10]。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Bound 从未被违反（soundness 成立），但 5.6~6.9x 的 tightness ratio 意味着 bound 提供的是\n      conservative certificate。审稿人可能的反应：\"bound 太 loose，实际指导价值有限\"。应对策略：\n      (1) 强调 bound 的 comparative value——IMM 训练后 Δ_k 从 0.01 提升到 0.93（93x），即使 bound\n      是 6x loose，认证区域仍扩大了 93/6 ≈ 15x；\n      (2) 强调 bound 作为 training objective design principle 的价值——最大化 Δ_k 的动机来自 bound，\n      实验证明这个方向正确；\n      (3) 承认 tightening bound 是 future work（可能通过 data-dependent Lipschitz 估计）。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-Compression Validation (IMM + FastV/VLA-IAP/VLA-Cache)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_006\"\n    description: >\n      IMM 叠加到 FastV、VLA-IAP、VLA-Cache 三种现有压缩方法上，对比各方法 baseline vs +IMM 的鲁棒性。\n    expected_results:\n      fastv:\n        baseline_eps001_preservation: 0.36\n        imm_eps001_preservation: 0.89\n        baseline_G3: 1.00\n        imm_G3: 0.94\n        preservation_gain_pp: 53.0\n      vla_iap:\n        baseline_eps001_preservation: 0.38\n        imm_eps001_preservation: 0.90\n        baseline_G3: 1.00\n        imm_G3: 0.97\n        preservation_gain_pp: 52.0\n      vla_cache:\n        baseline_eps001_preservation: 0.33\n        imm_eps001_preservation: 0.88\n        baseline_G3: 1.00\n        imm_G3: 1.02\n        preservation_gain_pp: 55.0\n      avg_preservation_gain_pp: 53.3\n      avg_G3_with_imm: 0.98\n      cross_method_margin_ratio_range: [18, 45]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 cross_model_margin_ratio 在 [15, 50]。IMM 训练的 margin maximization 是在\n      ACIS importance scoring 上进行的，与下游具体用哪种压缩方法无关——ACIS 训练完成后，FastV/VLA-IAP/\n      VLA-Cache 各自用自己的 token selection 策略，但 IMM 训练过的 backbone 对 token importance\n      分布本身已经被 restructured（高重要性 token 的 score 与低重要性 token 拉开了更大间距）。因此\n      不管用哪种 selection 策略，被选中/被丢弃的 token 集合在扰动下更稳定。\n      G3 接近 1.0（0.94~1.02）因为 IMM two-stage 对 backbone 的修改是通过 Stage2 LoRA 完成的，\n      影响范围有限，不会严重干扰其他压缩方法的工作方式。VLA-Cache 的 G3 略>1.0 因为它的 KV-cache\n      eviction 策略本身就不依赖 token importance scoring，IMM 的修改对它影响最小。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: IMM as Plugin for Existing Compression Methods\"\n        columns: [\"Compression Method\", \"Pres. (baseline)\", \"Pres. (+IMM)\", \"Gain (pp)\", \"G3 (+IMM)\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"FastV\", \"0.36\", \"0.89\", \"+53\", \"0.94\"]\n          - [\"VLA-IAP\", \"0.38\", \"0.90\", \"+52\", \"0.97\"]\n          - [\"VLA-Cache\", \"0.33\", \"0.88\", \"+55\", \"1.02\"]\n          - [\"ACIS (ours)\", \"0.34\", \"0.90\", \"+56\", \"0.87\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Grouped bar chart: 4 compression methods × 2 conditions (baseline vs +IMM)，y 轴 preservation rate。所有 baseline bars 在 0.33~0.38，所有 +IMM bars 在 0.88~0.90，形成强烈视觉对比。\"\n    analysis: >\n      IMM 对所有测试的压缩方法都提供 ~53pp 的 preservation rate 提升，G3 在 0.94~1.02 范围，证明\n      IMM 是 compression-agnostic 的训练策略。这是 paper 的一个 strong selling point——IMM 不是又一个\n      新压缩方法，而是一个可以叠加到任何现有方法上的 robustness layer。审稿人可能追问 overhead：\n      IMM 训练需要额外 Stage1，推理时需要 ACIS module——这由 plan_011 量化。\n\n  - name: \"Defense Comparison (IMM vs AT vs RS vs Jacobian Reg)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_007\"\n    description: >\n      IMM vs adversarial training vs randomized smoothing vs RobustVLA Jacobian regularization，\n      在 LIBERO 设置下标准+扰动条件的对比。\n    expected_results:\n      clean_success_rate:\n        baseline: 0.68\n        imm: 0.67\n        adversarial_training: 0.62\n        randomized_smoothing: 0.64\n        jacobian_reg: 0.66\n      perturbed_eps001_success_rate:\n        baseline: 0.51\n        imm: 0.63\n        adversarial_training: 0.59\n        randomized_smoothing: 0.56\n        jacobian_reg: 0.57\n      perturbed_eps005_success_rate:\n        baseline: 0.32\n        imm: 0.48\n        adversarial_training: 0.46\n        randomized_smoothing: 0.41\n        jacobian_reg: 0.42\n      training_overhead_relative:\n        imm: 1.3\n        adversarial_training: 3.2\n        randomized_smoothing: 1.0\n        jacobian_reg: 1.8\n      compression_compatible:\n        imm: true\n        adversarial_training: false\n        randomized_smoothing: false\n        jacobian_reg: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      IMM 在 perturbed 条件下优于其他方法但优势不大（+4~7pp vs AT, +7~12pp vs RS/JR），在 clean\n      条件下几乎无损（-1pp）。AT 在 clean 上损失最多（-6pp），因为 adversarial training 的 min-max\n      优化牺牲了 clean performance 换 robust performance——经典的 accuracy-robustness tradeoff。\n      RS 的 clean 损失来自 inference-time noise injection 的 variance。JR 的损失来自 Jacobian\n      约束限制了模型表达能力。\n      IMM 的独特优势不在于 robustness 绝对值（与 AT 接近），而在于 (1) 几乎不损失 clean performance，\n      (2) 兼容 token compression（其他方法都不提供 compression），(3) 训练开销较低（1.3x vs AT 的 3.2x）。\n      这是 Pareto improvement 叙事的核心支撑。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Defense Method Comparison (LIBERO-avg)\"\n        columns: [\"Method\", \"Clean SR\", \"ε=0.01 SR\", \"ε=0.05 SR\", \"Train Cost\", \"Compression?\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Baseline\", \"68%\", \"51%\", \"32%\", \"1.0x\", \"—\"]\n          - [\"IMM (ours)\", \"67%\", \"63%\", \"48%\", \"1.3x\", \"✓ 50%\"]\n          - [\"Adversarial Training\", \"62%\", \"59%\", \"46%\", \"3.2x\", \"✗\"]\n          - [\"Randomized Smoothing\", \"64%\", \"56%\", \"41%\", \"1.0x\", \"✗\"]\n          - [\"Jacobian Reg\", \"66%\", \"57%\", \"42%\", \"1.8x\", \"✗\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Pareto front plot: x 轴 clean SR，y 轴 perturbed SR (ε=0.01)。IMM 在右上角（高 clean + 高 robust），AT 在左上偏下（低 clean + medium robust），RS/JR 在中间。标注 IMM 为 Pareto optimal。\"\n    analysis: >\n      IMM 是唯一同时提供 compression + robustness 且 clean performance 几乎无损的方法。但优势幅度不大\n      （vs AT 仅 +4pp @ε=0.01），审稿人可能认为 \"AT 不需要 ACIS 模块更简单\"。应对：强调 IMM 是\n      compression-aware defense（场景不同），且训练成本仅 1.3x（AT 需 3.2x）。在 median 档下这个结果\n      足以 support \"Pareto improvement\" claim 但不足以声称 \"dominant defense\"。\n\n  - name: \"Pruning Ratio Sweep\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_008\"\n    description: >\n      k_ratio = 0.3/0.4/0.5/0.6/0.7/0.8/0.9 下 G3 deploy ratio 曲线，找最优压缩点。\n    expected_results:\n      ratio_030:\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 1.18\n        action_loss: 0.0048\n        eps001_preservation: 0.92\n      ratio_040:\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 1.03\n        action_loss: 0.0042\n        eps001_preservation: 0.91\n      ratio_050:\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.87\n        action_loss: 0.0035\n        eps001_preservation: 0.90\n      ratio_060:\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.83\n        action_loss: 0.0034\n        eps001_preservation: 0.89\n      ratio_070:\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.89\n        action_loss: 0.0036\n        eps001_preservation: 0.88\n      ratio_080:\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.95\n        action_loss: 0.0039\n        eps001_preservation: 0.87\n      ratio_090:\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.99\n        action_loss: 0.0040\n        eps001_preservation: 0.86\n      optimal_ratio: 0.60\n      sweet_spot_range: [0.50, 0.70]\n    result_rationale: >\n      Pruning ratio sweep 展示一个 U-shaped G3 curve：\n      - ratio 0.3 (保留 30% token): 过度压缩，丢弃了部分有用 token，G3=1.18（18% degradation）。\n      - ratio 0.4~0.5: 进入 sweet spot，denoising effect 开始主导——删除的 token 主要是低信息量的，\n        删除它们减少了 action prediction 中的 noise source。G3<1.0。\n      - ratio 0.6: 最优点 G3=0.83，保留 60% token 时 denoising 效果最强——足够的 token 被删除来\n        产生 denoising，但没多到丢失关键信息。\n      - ratio 0.7~0.9: 删除太少 token，denoising 效果减弱（fewer noise tokens removed），G3 逐渐\n        回到 1.0。\n      Preservation rate 随 ratio 增大单调微降（0.92→0.86），因为保留更多 token 意味着更多 borderline\n      token 被包含，这些 token 的 importance score 接近 threshold，更容易被扰动翻转。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Pruning Ratio Sweep (SmolVLA, aloha_sim_insertion)\"\n        columns: [\"Keep Ratio\", \"Action Loss\", \"G3 Ratio\", \"ε=0.01 Pres.\", \"Tokens Kept\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"0.30\", \"0.0048\", \"1.18\", \"0.92\", \"87/290\"]\n          - [\"0.40\", \"0.0042\", \"1.03\", \"0.91\", \"116/290\"]\n          - [\"0.50\", \"0.0035\", \"0.87\", \"0.90\", \"145/290\"]\n          - [\"0.60\", \"0.0034\", \"0.83\", \"0.89\", \"174/290\"]\n          - [\"0.70\", \"0.0036\", \"0.89\", \"0.88\", \"203/290\"]\n          - [\"0.80\", \"0.0039\", \"0.95\", \"0.87\", \"232/290\"]\n          - [\"0.90\", \"0.0040\", \"0.99\", \"0.86\", \"261/290\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Dual y-axis line plot: x 轴 keep ratio (0.3→0.9)，左 y 轴 G3 ratio (U-shaped curve, min at 0.6)，右 y 轴 preservation rate (gentle downward slope)。horizontal dashed line at G3=1.0。Green shading for 'denoising zone' (G3<1.0)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      U-shape curve 支持 denoising hypothesis——存在一个 sweet spot (0.5~0.7) 在该范围内 compression\n      is beneficial。但这不是 conclusive evidence：同样的 U-shape 可能由 regularization effect（类似\n      dropout）解释，不一定是 \"removing noisy tokens\"。论文应将此作为 \"empirical observation consistent\n      with denoising hypothesis\" 而非 strong causal claim。最优点在 0.6 而非 0.5 说明 paper 中使用的\n      50% 不是最优选择——但 0.5 是更标准的比较点，且 G3=0.87 已经 <1.0。\n\n  - name: \"Token Importance Analysis (Attention & Gradient)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_009\"\n    description: >\n      分析被 ACIS 删除 vs 保留 token 的 attention weight 分布、与 action prediction 的 gradient 相关性。\n    expected_results:\n      pruned_token_avg_attn_weight: 0.0018\n      kept_token_avg_attn_weight: 0.0041\n      attn_weight_ratio: 0.44\n      pruned_token_avg_grad_norm: 0.0012\n      kept_token_avg_grad_norm: 0.0038\n      grad_norm_ratio: 0.32\n      attn_weight_ks_test_p: 0.003\n      grad_norm_ks_test_p: 0.008\n      cohen_d_attn: 0.42\n      cohen_d_grad: 0.51\n      spearman_importance_vs_attn: 0.38\n      spearman_importance_vs_grad: 0.45\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median 档预测 pruned_token_attn_weight_ratio 在 [0.3, 0.6]。被 ACIS 标记为低重要性并删除的\n      token 在 action decoder 的 cross-attention 中确实接收更少 attention（ratio 0.44）——这些 token\n      携带的信息对 action prediction 贡献较小。Gradient norm ratio 0.32 也支持这一点——被删除 token\n      对 action loss 的梯度贡献更小。\n      但 effect size 中等（Cohen's d = 0.42~0.51），不是大效应（d>0.8）。这意味着分布有 overlap——\n      部分被删除的 token 的 attention weight 其实不低，部分被保留的 token 的 attention weight 也不高。\n      ACIS 学到的 importance 与 attention/gradient 有中等正相关（Spearman 0.38~0.45），说明 ACIS\n      捕捉了部分但非全部的 task-relevance 信号。\n      这足以支持 \"consistent with denoising hypothesis\" 但不够强到作为独立 claim。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Token Analysis — Pruned vs Kept\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Pruned Tokens\", \"Kept Tokens\", \"Ratio\", \"Cohen's d\", \"p-value\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Avg Attention Weight\", \"0.0018\", \"0.0041\", \"0.44\", \"0.42\", \"0.003\"]\n          - [\"Avg Gradient Norm\", \"0.0012\", \"0.0038\", \"0.32\", \"0.51\", \"0.008\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Violin plot (split): 左半 pruned tokens、右半 kept tokens，y 轴 attention weight。Kept 分布重心更高但有 overlap。标注 Cohen's d 和 p-value。\"\n      - \"Scatter plot: x 轴 ACIS importance score，y 轴 action-head attention weight，每点一个 token (subsample 1000)。标注 Spearman ρ=0.38。颜色编码 pruned (red) vs kept (blue)，分界线处有明显混合。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Token analysis 提供 \"部分证据\" 支持 denoising 假设：被删除 token 确实平均而言 task-relevance 更低，\n      但 effect size 中等且分布有 overlap。这不足以排除其他解释（如 regularization/implicit ensemble）。\n      论文中应呈现为 supplementary analysis，措辞为 \"the attention and gradient analysis is consistent\n      with an importance-guided denoising interpretation, though the moderate effect sizes suggest\n      additional mechanisms may contribute\"。审稿人可能接受这个 level 的 evidence 用于 analysis section，\n      但如果放在 core contribution 中会被质疑不够 conclusive。\n\n  - name: \"v8c Annealing Ablation (mask ratio 0.9→0.5)\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_010\"\n    description: >\n      Mask ratio annealing (0.9→0.5 during Stage1) vs two-stage 固定 0.5 对比。已在 cuda:0 运行中。\n    expected_results:\n      v8c_annealing:\n        acis_prune50_action_loss: 0.0038\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.93\n        margin_median: 0.85\n        eps001_preservation: 0.91\n        training_stability: \"smoother convergence curve\"\n      v8b_fixed:\n        acis_prune50_action_loss: 0.0035\n        G3_deploy_ratio: 0.87\n        margin_median: 0.93\n        eps001_preservation: 0.90\n        training_stability: \"slight oscillation in early steps\"\n      delta_G3: 0.06\n      delta_margin: -0.08\n    result_rationale: >\n      Annealing (0.9→0.5) 在 Stage1 早期让 ACIS 看到几乎所有 token（mask ratio 0.9 = keep 90%），\n      逐步增加压缩难度。这产生更平滑的训练曲线但最终 margin 略低于固定 0.5——因为 ACIS 在早期 \"easy\"\n      阶段学到了较宽松的 importance 分布，切换到 0.5 时需要 re-sharpen，但训练结束前可能不完全收敛。\n      G3=0.93 vs 0.87，annealing 版本的 denoising effect 更弱（删除的 token 不如固定 0.5 版本\n      那么 confidently low-importance）。两者差距不大（0.06），annealing 的价值更多在训练稳定性\n      而非最终性能。论文可能只在 appendix 中提及。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Annealing vs Fixed Mask Ratio\"\n        columns: [\"Strategy\", \"Action Loss\", \"G3\", \"Margin\", \"ε=0.01 Pres.\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Fixed 0.5 (v8b)\", \"0.0035\", \"0.87\", \"0.93\", \"0.90\"]\n          - [\"Anneal 0.9→0.5 (v8c)\", \"0.0038\", \"0.93\", \"0.85\", \"0.91\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Training loss curve comparison: 两条线（v8b vs v8c），x 轴 step，y 轴 Stage1 loss。v8c 更平滑但最终略高。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Annealing 不优于固定 mask ratio，主要价值在于训练稳定性。在 median 档下两者差距不大（G3 差 0.06），\n      paper 应以 v8b（固定 0.5）为主结果，annealing 作为 ablation 放 appendix。这也暗示 mask ratio\n      的选择不是 critical hyperparameter——在合理范围内结果 robust。\n\n  - name: \"ACIS Overhead Quantification\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_011\"\n    description: >\n      ACIS 模块的参数量、FLOPs、推理延迟测量。证明部署成本可忽略。\n    expected_results:\n      acis_params_M: 2.3\n      backbone_params_M: 500\n      param_overhead_pct: 0.46\n      acis_flops_G: 0.18\n      backbone_flops_G: 45.2\n      flop_overhead_pct: 0.40\n      inference_latency_ms_without_acis: 42.5\n      inference_latency_ms_with_acis: 43.1\n      latency_overhead_ms: 0.6\n      latency_overhead_pct: 1.4\n      throughput_tokens_per_sec_without: 6800\n      throughput_tokens_per_sec_with_compression: 11200\n      throughput_gain_pct: 64.7\n      net_speedup_with_50pct_compression: 1.62\n    result_rationale: >\n      ACIS 是一个 lightweight cross-attention module（2~3M params），相对于 SmolVLA 的 500M backbone\n      开销 <0.5%。推理时 ACIS 只需要一次 forward pass 来产生 importance scores，然后 top-k selection\n      是 O(n log n) 的排序操作——latency 几乎可忽略（+0.6ms）。\n      但 ACIS 带来的 50% token compression 使后续 transformer 层的计算量大幅减少（attention 是 O(n²)，\n      token 减半意味着 attention 计算减少 75%，但只有 decoder 部分受益），净 throughput 提升约 64%。\n      这意味着 ACIS 的 overhead 被 compression 的效率增益远远补偿——实际上是 net positive。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: ACIS Deployment Overhead\"\n        columns: [\"Metric\", \"Without ACIS\", \"With ACIS+Compress\", \"Overhead/Gain\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Parameters\", \"500M\", \"502.3M\", \"+0.46%\"]\n          - [\"FLOPs per step\", \"45.2G\", \"27.6G\", \"-39% (net)\"]\n          - [\"Latency (ms)\", \"42.5\", \"26.8\", \"-37% (net)\"]\n          - [\"Throughput (tok/s)\", \"6800\", \"11200\", \"+64.7%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Stacked bar: 左 bar 为 without ACIS (full tokens)，右 bar 为 with ACIS+compression，分段颜色表示 ACIS overhead (tiny red slice) 和 compression saving (large green reduction)。\"\n    analysis: >\n      ACIS overhead 几乎可忽略（<0.5% params, +0.6ms latency），而 50% compression 带来 ~37% latency\n      reduction 和 65% throughput gain。这有效回应 RC4——ACIS 不是 deployment burden 而是 deployment\n      accelerator。论文应将此呈现为 \"ACIS adds negligible overhead while enabling substantial inference\n      speedup through principled compression\"。\n\n  - name: \"LIBERO-Plus 7-Dimension Perturbation Evaluation\"\n    plan_id: \"plan_012\"\n    description: >\n      IMM+compression 在 LIBERO-Plus 7 维扰动（camera, lighting, texture, distractors, table color,\n      scene structure, combined）上的 success rate 评估。Headline result 所需的完整鲁棒性评估。\n    expected_results:\n      baseline_no_compress:\n        camera: 0.58\n        lighting: 0.61\n        texture: 0.55\n        distractors: 0.52\n        table_color: 0.63\n        scene_structure: 0.48\n        combined: 0.35\n        clean: 0.68\n      baseline_compress50:\n        camera: 0.41\n        lighting: 0.45\n        texture: 0.39\n        distractors: 0.36\n        table_color: 0.47\n        scene_structure: 0.33\n        combined: 0.20\n        clean: 0.67\n      imm_compress50:\n        camera: 0.55\n        lighting: 0.59\n        texture: 0.52\n        distractors: 0.49\n        table_color: 0.61\n        scene_structure: 0.45\n        combined: 0.31\n        clean: 0.67\n      imm_vs_baseline_compress_avg_gain_pp: 14.3\n      imm_vs_baseline_nocompress_avg_loss_pp: -2.6\n      headline_template_fill:\n        benchmark: \"LIBERO\"\n        X_success: \"67%\"\n        Y_epsilon: \"camera+lighting+texture\"\n        Z_baseline_retain: \"40%\"\n        imm_retain: \"55%\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      LIBERO-Plus 扰动直接改变视觉输入，测试 VLA 的感知鲁棒性。Baseline+compression 在扰动下严重退化\n      （clean 67% → combined 20%）因为 token compression 在扰动输入上的 importance ranking 不稳定——\n      扰动使关键 token 被误判为不重要而被删除。\n      IMM 训练后 compression 在扰动下表现显著改善（combined 31% vs 20%，+11pp），因为 margin 最大化\n      使 importance ranking 对输入扰动更稳定。但 IMM+compress 仍不如 baseline no-compress（31% vs 35%），\n      说明 compression 在 combined 极端扰动下仍有不可避免的信息损失。\n      在单维扰动上 IMM+compress 接近 baseline no-compress（差距 2~5pp），这是 median 档的核心结果：\n      IMM 使 compressed model 在常见扰动下的表现接近 uncompressed model，compression 的 robustness\n      cost 从 ~17pp 缩小到 ~3pp。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: LIBERO-Plus 7-Dimension Robustness (Success Rate %)\"\n        columns: [\"Perturbation\", \"No Compress\", \"Compress 50%\", \"IMM+Compress 50%\", \"IMM Gain vs Compress\"]\n        rows:\n          - [\"Clean\", \"68\", \"67\", \"67\", \"+0\"]\n          - [\"Camera\", \"58\", \"41\", \"55\", \"+14\"]\n          - [\"Lighting\", \"61\", \"45\", \"59\", \"+14\"]\n          - [\"Texture\", \"55\", \"39\", \"52\", \"+13\"]\n          - [\"Distractors\", \"52\", \"36\", \"49\", \"+13\"]\n          - [\"Table Color\", \"63\", \"47\", \"61\", \"+14\"]\n          - [\"Scene Structure\", \"48\", \"33\", \"45\", \"+12\"]\n          - [\"Combined\", \"35\", \"20\", \"31\", \"+11\"]\n          - [\"Avg Perturbed\", \"53.1\", \"37.3\", \"50.3\", \"+13.0\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Radar chart: 7 axes (one per perturbation type)。三条线（no-compress: blue, compress: red, IMM+compress: green）。IMM+compress 线几乎与 no-compress 重叠（除 combined 维度外），compress 线明显内缩。\"\n      - \"Headline figure: 横向 bar chart，每个扰动类型三个 bar 上下排列，清晰展示 IMM 恢复了 compression 丢失的 robustness。\"\n    analysis: >\n      LIBERO-Plus 结果是 paper 的 headline result。核心 message：\"IMM closes the robustness gap between\n      compressed and uncompressed VLAs under realistic perturbations\"。在单维扰动下 IMM+compress 与\n      no-compress 仅差 ~3pp（平均），而 naive compression 差 ~16pp。Combined 扰动下差距更大（4pp vs 15pp）\n      但方向一致。\n      Headline 可写为：\"On LIBERO-Plus, IMM-trained SmolVLA achieves 50.3% average success under\n      50% token compression + visual perturbation, recovering 78% of the robustness lost by standard\n      compression (37.3% → 50.3% vs 53.1%), while providing the first certified robustness guarantee\n      for VLA token compression.\"\n      审稿人可能注意到 IMM+compress 仍不如 no-compress——这是诚实的 median 档结果，paper 不应声称\n      compression is free，而应强调 robustness-compression tradeoff 的 Pareto improvement。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"ad349d52-f73d-4c40-8303-08fdd9f7e4c9","total_cost_usd":0.46926149999999994,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":12620,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"outp